SUMMARY:EBR/VIP Seminar: Professor Tim Hore — Unlocking the Female Ribosome
LOCATION:Roslin Institute Auditorium
DESCRIPTION:Professor Tim Hore, University of Otago, New Zealand — 'Unlocking the Female Ribosome and the Epigenetic Androgen Clock'. Work on feminine ribosomal DNA (fem-rDNA) and the first successful knockout of rDNA in a vertebrate (Danio rerio). Host: Dr Doug Vernimmen.
